      "created_at": "2017-12-15T01:01:58Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-12-15T01:01:58Z",
      "body": "I fail to see the issue. Any realistic web application holds info linked to user accounts that isn't privacy related (time zone, preferred language, activation status of the account...).\r\n\r\nEven if GDPR forbids this practice (after all, I'm no legal expert), it is the job of the application developer to be law compliant. This isn't the task of the framework...\r\n\r\n",
